  documentId: cc2df02c25ce415ea110e4f005669f57
  title: Document_02
  author: Night guard
  summary: A note left beside the old entrance.
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  inspectionPrefab: {fileID: 3478250968449132555, guid: bcc72ae0dcae4bf8ba014736f2fdd103, type: 3}
  inspectionRotation: {x: 0, y: 25, z: 0}
  pages:
  - 'October 7


    The lights in the east wing went out again. I heard footsteps
    above the locked storeroom, although nobody should be there.


    I left a spare
    key with the caretaker. If I do not return before dawn, check the service entrance.'
  - 'The radio stopped working at 02:15.


    Someone knocked three times from the
    other side of the door. The voice sounded like mine.


    Do not answer it.'
